<title>USA: MarkWest Hydrocarbon names finance chief.</title>
<headline>MarkWest Hydrocarbon names finance chief.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MarkWest Hydrocarbon Inc, a natural gas processing services company, on Wednesday said it hired Gerald Tywoniuk for the new post of chief financial officer and vice president of finance.</p>
<p>Tywoniuk is a former vice president and controller of Echo Bay Mines Ltd.</p>
